    # dwy "[name]."
    dwy "[name]."

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:64
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_22310894:

    # dwy "I spotted your nemesis here today."
    dwy "我看到你的死对头今天在这里。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:66
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_da9c8cdf:

    # mc "Spotted as in helped or saw?"
    mc "看到你是说帮忙还是看到的？"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:68
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_cba4b8db:

    # dwy "Saw. The tri-alphas don't do PTs."
    dwy "见了。三阿尔法兄弟会不搞健身训练。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:69
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_24875179:

    # dwy "He was benching at least 400 lbs, and I think he'd call it warmup."
    dwy "他至少能举400磅，我觉得那只是热身。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:70
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_7be5fdb4:

    # dwy "You're seriously not gonna fight him, are you?"
    dwy "你他妈真不打算跟他干一架，对吧？"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:75
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_9cfc1ac7:

    # mc "I'm preparing myself for a fight. I have a feeling it could happen if our frats go head-to-head again."
    mc "我在为一场战斗做准备。我觉得如果兄弟会之间再碰面，事情可能会升级。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:76
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_eb82b0fb:

    # mc "And no one else in my frat would ever fight him. That's why I want to feel confident enough to kick his ass."
    mc "而且我兄弟会里没人会跟他动手。这就是我想要足够自信，狠狠教训他一顿的原因。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:78
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_0d4dba9e:

    # dwy "Man, you're crazy. But I've made bad calls, too. I'll let you make yours."
    dwy "哥们儿，你真疯了。不过我以前也做过些蠢事。我让你按你的想法去干。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:81
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_9c140e1d:

    # mc "It's not so much a goal as it is self-defense. That's what fighting always was to me."
    mc "这不算是什么目标，更多是自保。打架对我而言一直就是这个意思。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:82
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_34ad0c37:

    # mc "If the day comes when he comes at me, I want to be prepared to defend myself. That's all."
    mc "如果那天他冲我来，我希望自己能做好准备自卫。就这么简单。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:84
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_2c4743b5:

    # dwy "Ain't nothing wrong with that."
    dwy "这没什么不对的。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:85
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_261d0dd4:

    # dwy "I thought of a kicking technique that will work great for you. To slow down any bigger opponent."
    dwy "我想到了一个适合你的踢法，对付比你大的对手特别管用。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:86
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_c66db9ed:

    # dwy "It works wonders on lesser ones, too. Want me to teach you?"
    dwy "这招对小角色也管用。想学吗？"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:88
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_d65f97fb:

    # mc "I liked what you showed me last time. Sign me up."
    mc "我喜欢你上次教我的那些东西，我要报名参加。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:90
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_ec826c4f:

    # dwy "You gotta earn it, though. I want to spar, and I'm looking at you."
    dwy "你得用自己的实力证明，我想要切磋，现在轮到你了。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:92
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_eb34531a:

    # mc "Sure, we can go a bout."
    mc "好，咱们来干一架。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:94
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane1_label_144d3d77:

    # dwy "Prove that you're worth it."
    dwy "证明你配得上它。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:113
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane_after1_label_ad0103be:

    # dwy "Hm... You're getting better, but you're still not good enough."
    dwy "哼... 你进步了，但还不够好。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:114
translate schinese brawler_story_dwyane_after1_label_445b8abd:

    # dwy "You gotta practice more. Let's take a break."
    dwy "你得再多练练。我们休息一下吧。"

