    mc "也许是因为我们现在只是互相切磋，彼此留手。要是真打起来，我肯定很难对付你。"

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:230
translate schinese brawler_story_tate_after1_label_8104ec6e:

    # tate "Thanks, [name]."
    tate "谢谢[name]."

# minigames\brawler_new\story\brawler_story_ep11.rpy:247
